WEBVTT

NOTE tts=synthetic

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.567
Chisel or moil point? How to choose a breaker tool type

2
00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:09.000
A chisel has a flat edge and strikes along a line.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.167
A moil point focuses the blow on a single point and penetrates.

4
00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:16.400
A blunt tool spreads the blow over a wide face.

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.800
A pyramid tool combines the penetration of a moil point with a tougher tip.

6
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:28.233
Whatever the type, the diameter, length and key slot are set by your breaker model.
